<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήρης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραρίσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-fitted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>) always of the oar, <i>well-poised, easy to handle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβὼν εὐ. ἐρετμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.121
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ εὐήρε᾽ ἐρετμά</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				125
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεὼς εὐ. πίτυλος</span>
			the plash <i>of the well-poised oars</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1050
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					65
				</span></i>
			; <i>well-knit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα εὐ. πρὸς τὴν
				χρείαν</span>
			<i>well-fitted for</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Medic.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τεύχη</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.12.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήρεας ἵππους,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγώγους</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήρις</span>, pr. n. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.27.4
			</span></i> (s.v.l.).</div>
